The rooms are neatly furnished with the essentials for a restful stay, and each morning guests are served a freshly prepared breakfast to start the day. The hosts offer warm South African hospitality, helping visitors feel at home whether they are staying a single night or longer. The peaceful surroundings make it easy to unwind after a day of meetings or sightseeing, while good road links connect Mandalay to the wider Cape Town area. It makes a practical base for exploring the region. Khaya B&B is at 12 Hermes Way, Mandalay, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'khaya-b-and-b-mandalay-mandalay' AND description = 'Khaya B&B Mandalay is a bed and breakfast guesthouse offering overnight accommodation in Mandalay, Cape Town.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
