The range includes kitchenware and household items, toys and novelties, party supplies for birthdays and celebrations, stationery for school and the office, pet products and seasonal gifts that change through the year. Because there is so much variety, it is a handy place to pick up a last-minute present, decorate for a party or restock everyday basics without spending much. For Parklands families watching their budgets, it is a convenient local stop for value buys. The Crazy Store is at Shops 3, 4 and 5, Piazza Centre, Parklands, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'the-crazy-store-piazza-centre-parklands' AND description = 'The Crazy Store Piazza Centre is a variety and general merchandise retailer in the Piazza Centre, Parklands.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
