The menu is built around inventive small plates designed for sharing, inspired by flavours from around the world and grouped by taste: sweet, sour, salty, bitter and umami. Guests are encouraged to order a range of dishes for the table and explore different combinations as the meal goes on. An open kitchen adds energy to the room, and the stylish industrial-chic interior suits the building''s history as part of an old biscuit factory. It is a popular choice for food lovers wanting a memorable meal out, a celebration with friends or a special date night. The Potluck Club is at the Silo, top floor, The Old Biscuit Mill, 373–375 Albert Road, Woodstock.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'the-potluck-club-woodstock' AND description = 'The Potluck Club is a restaurant on the top floor of the Silo Building at The Old Biscuit Mill in Woodstock.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
